Source: omaxian-typecase
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/iretonsean/typecase
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: omaxian-typecase
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, chromium, fontconfig, curl, ca-certificates
Description: font manager and typesetting canvas (Typecase)
 Typecase browses installed fonts, installs fonts from a link, and opens a
 small typesetting canvas. It is a local Python server plus a Chromium
 app window (github.com/iretonsean/typecase). This package vendors the
 pinned commit from config/build.conf; nothing is fetched at run time
 except what the user asks Typecase to install.
